msgstr "正在加载历史记录…"

msgid "Swipe or scroll to see more dates."
msgstr "左右滑动或滚动图表，查看更多日期。"

msgid "Unable to load history. Please try again."
msgstr "暂时无法加载历史记录，请重试。"

msgid "Traffic scope"
msgstr "统计范围"

msgid "Internet only"
msgstr "仅互联网"

msgid "Internet + local (existing history)"
msgstr "互联网＋局域网（原有历史）"

msgid "Reset selected device counters"
msgstr "清空所选设备的计数"

msgid "History analysis"
msgstr "历史分析"

msgid "Compare recorded usage by date and device, then inspect past internet rates. Current speeds are on Zen home."
msgstr "按设备与日期回看用量，或切换到设备占比、过去速率。"

msgid "Device usage ranking"
msgstr "设备用量排名"

msgid "Internet-only daily records start when this version is installed and retain 90 days. Monthly bars sum these retained days. Older mixed records cannot be converted."
msgstr "每日互联网用量从本版本启用时开始记录，保留 90 天；月柱汇总这些已保留的日期。旧的混合用量不能转换。"

msgid "Existing history includes internet and local transfers: 90 days of daily records and 12 months of monthly records."
msgstr "原有历史包含互联网和局域网传输：每日记录保留 90 天，每月记录保留 12 个月。"

msgid "Recorded upload"
msgstr "所选记录上传"

msgid "Recorded download"
msgstr "所选记录下载"

msgid "Choose Internet only to compare devices with the upstream total."
msgstr "选择“仅互联网”，即可将设备用量与上游总量比较。"

msgid "Ranking covers the same retained 90-day internet window. Percentages use the upstream total; unassigned traffic is shown separately."
msgstr "排名汇总同一份已保留的 90 天互联网记录。占比以上游总量为分母，未归属流量单独列出。"

msgid "Share"
msgstr "占比"

msgid "Unassigned"
msgstr "未归属流量"

msgid "Attributed device usage exceeds the upstream total; percentages may exceed 100%."
msgstr "设备归属用量超过了上游总量，占比可能超过 100%。"

